Gemini API Quickstart README
This notebook demonstrates how to set up and use the new Google GenAI SDK to interact with Gemini models.

Setup Instructions
Installation: Install the official Google GenAI SDK:

pip install google-genai
API Key Configuration: Store your Gemini API key in Colab's Secrets manager (the key icon on the left sidebar) with the name GENAI_Week1Key.

Initialization: Retrieve the key securely and initialize the client:

from google import genai
from google.colab import userdata

api_key = userdata.get("GENAI_Week1Key")
client = genai.Client(api_key=api_key)
Generate Content: Use the client.models.generate_content method with the desired model (such as gemini-2.5-flash) to generate responses to prompts.
